Node ID=40 people
Text=Like the Prophet, we are outsiders, driven out by people who fear those who are touched by magic. When Nostradamus came to our caves to hide from his people, we took him in. He shared visions with my people that helped us. Now we protect him from outsiders that wish to harm him.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me more of the Prophet.
Go to node ID=30 Prophet

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you mean about helping or killing the Prophet?
Go to node ID=10 explanation

Requirement=Feralkin IS
Reply Text=My people were driven out of their towns with those same words.
