Text=Then you have heard the same words we heard, in whatever town your people were made to leave. <He looks at you properly for the first time.> The Prophet took us in when no one else would have us, and we have kept him since. If you have come to take him from the people who took you in, I will not say the rest of that out loud. Tell me which you have come to do.
